WEBVTT

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:23.000
Machi has been performing
rituals seriously lately.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.920
I bet she's had enough of being an idol.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.800
Well, I'm guilty of encouraging her
to do it, along with Yoshio.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:38.970
She must be trying hard
to forget about what happened.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.400
The motive really isn't a good one,
but this is for the best in my opinion.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.990
Hmm?

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.450
How old am I again?

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:00.620
How should I know?

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.750
Here's your mail!

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.920
Thank you very much.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:10.960
Tohoku...

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.380
Proud Idol Contest?

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.170
Huh?

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.470
Miss Yasuda, did you send in
your application by any chance?

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.100
Eh?!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.680
That's sexual harassment!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.770
They might have sent it
to the wrong address.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.060
Oh, that's for the application I sent in!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:37.990
Whoa!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.490
Hm? Let me see...

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.830
"Based on the impartial document screening,

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:48.420
your applicant, Miss Amayadori Machi,
has passed the initial screening.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:48.420
your applicant, Amayadori Machi-san,
has passed the initial screening.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.670
We sincerely look forward to her
participation in the final selection."

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.340
All right!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.980
Well... this calls for a celebration!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.730
Machi-chan is gonna be an idol!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.900
Machi is gonna be an idol!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.990
This isn't the time for field work!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.700
Machi is gonna debut as an idol!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.780
Machi-chan is gonna debut as an idol!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.410
Hey...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.250
You're getting too carried away, Matsu.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.250
You're getting too carried away, Matsu-san.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.910
This is big news!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.540
Kumade 48!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.080
Tokyo Dome!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.130
Kumade Village might be chosen
for location shooting for a taiga drama!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.630
Matsu, you have been drinking too much.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.840
What do we do?!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.260
By the way, she's going
to Sendai, not Tokyo.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.550
Hollywood!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.010
Beverly Hills!

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:11.850
Our village will become a tourist spot
and many people will visit it!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.400
Sylvezter Sdasdasdallone!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.280
Hey, Hiiko! Good timing!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.990
We're headed to see Machi, so come along.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.950
Why? Such a pain.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.450
You're her manager, right?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.290
Now, hop in.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.340
Whaaaaaaat?!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.760
You don't wanna go?!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.260
I won't go.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.930
Why?!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.270
You were so motivated before!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.980
Seriously... you change your mind so quickly.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.650
This knot is too tight.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.150
What's going on?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.910
Oh, Natsu!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:11.370
Machi says that she doesn't wanna
compete in the idol contest!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:14.000
I don't think you can blame her.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.920
Why?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.420
You can finally go to Sendai!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.170
It's Sendai, the big city you dreamed of!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.050
I-Idol...

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:23.970
What?

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.550
Beast! Beast!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.880
Watch out, Machi!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.880
Watch out, Machi-chan!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.140
I don't wanna be an idol.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.810
Oh, stop joking.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.430
I don't wanna do it!
I don't wanna do it! I don't wanna do it!

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.860
What should I do...?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.690
I think that's enough.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.440
You can see that she really
doesn't wanna do it.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.820
You should give up.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.410
She's made it this far without a problem.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.620
I can't just give up now!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.580
This isn't good.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.120
What is it that she doesn't like about it?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:00.920
Machi?!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.380
Sh-She ran away...

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.890
Hey, Machi...

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.640
We should go back, it'll get dark soon.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.600
It'd be terrible if you got attacked by
ferocious animals on the road at night.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.360
Machi...

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.480
Stay away!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.650
If you come any closer, I'll jump off here!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.740
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.990
An idol...?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.830
An idol...?

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.170
Stupid Yoshio!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.210
Stupid Yoshio-kun!

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.540
That's Machi's voice!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.880
Leave her alone now.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.050
I can't do that.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.130
I need her to keep at it!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.430
This is a golden opportunity
to promote Kumade Village!

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.560
Considering how much she
doesn't wanna be an idol,

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.020
there's no way it'll work!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.680
Huh?

00:06:58.850 --> 00:06:59.560
Huh?

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.400
Eh?

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.440
She doesn't wanna do it?

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.280
The sun is about to completely set...

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.950
I need to somehow get her off
the mountains right away...

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.410
You're right.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.830
Being an idol just isn't for you.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.250
But that's a shame.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.460
You rarely have an opportunity
to go to a big city like Sendai.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.930
I wish I could go to Sendai...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.550
The biggest fashion town in Tohoku region...

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:40.390
I bet it's filled with super stylish stores
that are beyond my imagination.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.440
Tall buildings...

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.900
Gorgeous fashion streets...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.490
And fashionable people
who go back and forth...

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.780
But you don't wanna go to Sendai...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:01.290
I-It's not like... I don't wanna go there... but...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.960
Then why don't you go?

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.830
But...

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.210
"But"?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.170
I-If a country bumpkin like me goes there,

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:14.050
I feel like people in Sendai will make fun of me.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.050
Wha—!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.310
What's... What's so funny?!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.270
Don't worry!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.520
You have cleared many city-girl missions, right?!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.440
The City Girl Quiz!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.690
Number 1 is correct!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.440
I can't! I can't! I can't!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.530
It's embarrassing!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.450
It'll be fine! It'll be fine!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.240
Delicious nameko...

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.950
How about sampling some?

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.910
Y-Yeah...

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.670
It's true that the idol contest may be tough.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.790
But if you clear this last mission...

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.210
...you'll be publicly acknowledged as a city girl!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.220
Acknowledged... as a city girl...?

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.680
Don't take it so hard.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:04.850
I was so convinced... that Machi
was happy about being an idol.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.190
No matter how you look at it,
she truly hated it, didn't she?

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.030
And how exactly did you
come to that conclusion?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.900
I thought that she was just being shy.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:17.410
How dense can he be?

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.200
I guess our village revitalization
is now going back to square one.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:25.960
I just wanted to make Kumade Village
the number-one village in Tohoku.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.540
He's crying...

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.550
So he's this devoted to the village...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.880
My contact slipped...

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.140
Machi!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.060
Yoshio, Machi wants to talk to you.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.490
I'm sorry, Machi!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.660
I'm sorry, I didn't realize how you were
feeling, and I dragged you into this!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.740
You don't have to be an idol anymore!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.580
You don't have to participate in the contest, either!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:09.420
I'll accept whatever punishment you think I deserve!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.710
Oh you,Yoshio...

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.960
U-Uhm, Yoshio...

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.090
Now, Machi...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.390
Yoshio... I'll...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.390
Yoshio-kun... I'll...

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.600
...participate in the contest.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.680
What did you just say?

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:29.100
I-I said... I'll participate in the contest.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.610
MMMMachi!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.440
That's what I wanted to hear!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.860
You're such a good girl, Machi!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.610
There, there, there, there, there! There—

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.580
Ouch!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.120
Where did your guilt go?!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.710
That was a really quick change!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.630
Why are you angry, Hiiko?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.630
Are you sure about this?

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.130
What?

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.880
I'm asking if you're really serious about
participating in the contest, you idiot!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:10:59.880
Ah...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.510
Y-Yeah.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.800
All right.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.020
If you're gonna do it, don't be
satisfied with a mediocre ranking.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:06.470
What?

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.940
Since you're competing, aim for the top!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:12.270
All right, you go-getter manager!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.440
What?!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:20.990
Now listen!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.950
What an idol needs the most
is stamina, and after that, willpower!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.950
Hey!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.080
Give it everything you have got!

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.660
I-I-I'm Amayadori Machi, 14 years old.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.000
I can't hear you!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.540
I'm Amayadori Machi , 14 years old!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:38.010
My favorite dessert is...
n-n-nameko pudding!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.210
Don't stutter!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:40.840
And don't close your eyes!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.180
One more time!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:45.550
I-I'm Amayadori Machi, 14 years old!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.560
M-My favorite dessert is nameko pudding!

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.560
Since she's a miko, she really
should perform kagura to compete!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.690
Isn't that a bit boring?

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.520
Why don't we use some hip-hop music, too?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.190
Good idea!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.320
No, that's not possible!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.030
Hey, Machi!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.030
Hey, Machi-chan!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.040
Good luck, Machi!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.040
Good luck, Machi-chan!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.410
Go for it!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.920
Go for it!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.710
Done!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.890
Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled pepp—

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.520
A-Acknowledged as a city girl...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:38.730
How much wood would a woodchuck chuck
if a woodchuck could chuck wood?!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.990
How much wood would a woodchuck chuck...

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.420
Go for it, Machi!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.420
Go for it, Machi-chan!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:58.500
Aim to be the Tohoku's number-one idol!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.750
Go for it! Machi

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.880
Machi, do your best!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.880
Machi-chan, do your best!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.840
Go for it, Machi!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.920
Go for it, Machi-chan!

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.050
Yeah.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.760
See you later!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.810
Hurray! Hurray!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.520
Hurray! Hurray!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.350
Don't lose!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.150
We're rooting for you!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.270
Yeah!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.900
See you later, then!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.530
See you later!

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:44.090
I-It's a real Shinkansen!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.340
Machi!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.680
Hurry up, or you'll miss the train!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.930
O-Okay!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.110
That, too?

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.900
The train goes puff-puff!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.320
The next station is Sendai! Sendai!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.330
Puff-puff! Puff-puff!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.870
Squeak! We arrived!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.370
That's Sendai's famous beef tongue!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.420
Natsu, you see...

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.130
When I visit Sendai, I'm gonna go to Parco.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.430
Well... I guess you wouldn't
know about that place.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.010
Goodbye, Natsu.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.710
I hope the village stays peaceful.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.540
I hope Machi won't have
a bad experience in the city.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:07.340
I hope the contest in Sendai goes well for her.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.530
Mountain gods...

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.110
I'm a bear with an unseemly heart.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:35.240
I tell Machi to adapt to modern society...

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.620
...but in my heart, I'm hoping
that she stays the way she is.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:47.750
I'm hoping that she becomes
unable to live outside the village!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.760
I'm a bad bear!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.380
I'm not qualified to be worshiped!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.220
I wish she hadn't gone to Sendai!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.720
I wish the Shinkansen would stop!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.980
I wish the bridge would collapse!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:28.090
Sendai Station

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:29.960
It's Sendai... I have...
finally come to... Sendai!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.220
Ah! That's Parco!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.090
Loft...!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.680
Wait, what is it?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.720
I'm glad that you were able to come to a city.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.390
Yeah.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.850
We will go Sendai sightseeing later.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.690
Let's go to the contest venue first!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.360
Proud

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.360
Ohhh...

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:57.120
This is a bigger event than I expected.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.330
Y-Yeah.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.160
Let's see...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.870
Looks like the waiting room is behind this area.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.250
Whoa! There are many of them!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.710
Hi! Long time no see!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.840
I'm so nervous!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.470
Let's do our best together!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.300
I'm nervous!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.260
One, two, three, four!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.470
If you don't get chosen, you're a loser.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.390
Got that?

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.640
They're all fired up!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.180
Ah!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.940
I was in a hurry!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.400
I'm sorry!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.400
I'm sorry-po!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.820
Oh, that's a country bumpkin girl.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.530
She seems super dimwitted.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.610
Are you okay?

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:34.610
Are you okay-po?

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.160
Y-Yes.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.870
Oof!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:39.620
Machi!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.160
This seat is available!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.750
This is the costume for the actual contest.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.500
Boy, Mom did a good job.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.170
That looks pretty good, doesn't it?

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.630
Hello.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.010
I'm Non Non.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:57.720
Nice to meet you.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:01.560
I-I'm Amayadori Ma... chi!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.600
Machi?

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.560
She's just a country bumpkin girl.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.140
Let's try our best!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.900
Okay, everyone!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.980
We're starting the rehearsal!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.190
Oh, shoot!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.650
Is it already that time?

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.400
Machi, hurry up and change!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:24.490
Okay.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:28.870
Then, contestants number 11 through 20

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.790
will appear in the second half!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:35.880
Well then, please step forward and
introduce yourself, starting with number 11!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.170
Okay!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:38.630
Here!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.220
Contestant number 11!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.220
I'm from Akita prefecture!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.220
I'm from Akita prefecture-po!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:45.140
I'm the kiritanpo idol, Ando Aki!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.850
As for my age, I'll leave it
to your imagination!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.890
As for my age, I'll leave it
to your imagination-po!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:54.610
Please eat kiritanpo to become
energetic, courageous and spirited!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:54.610
To become energetic, courageous
and spirited, please eat kiri-tan-po!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.450
The first one already has
a strong personality...

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.700
Okay, thank you very much!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.740
Thank you very much!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.740
Thank you very much-po!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.950
Well then, next, number 12,

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.200
please step forward!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:06.540
Okay!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.250
This is what it means to be an idol...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.080
There's no way that I can win!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.340
They speak smoothly even when
their introductions are that long...

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.010
Other girls seem to be
used to this kind of event...

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.430
They really are seriously
aiming to become idols.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:26.100
On the contrary, I'm just a country bumpkin
who casually came to a big city

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.350
after being lured by the possibility
of being acknowledged as a city girl...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.230
I came to the wrong place after all.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.360
They're in a whole other league.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:32.520
Machi...

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:32.520
Machi-chan...

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.150
Machi!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.150
Machi-chan!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.150
Huh?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.570
It's your turn, Machi.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.690
It's your turn, Mach-chani.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.950
Number 16, is something wrong?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.610
N-No!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.370
I'm okay—!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.070
Ow!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.830
Are you okay?

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.830
Y-Yes, I'm okay.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.080
U-Uhm...

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.330
I'm Amayadori Machi from
Kumade Village, 14 years old!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:59.090
M-My favorite dessert is...
na-na-namako pudding!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:00.470
"Namako"?!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.720
It's "nameko"!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.260
Th-Th-That's all!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:14.940
That looks painful.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:15.900
Machi!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.150
What's with her?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.240
She's so clumsy!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.990
She's lowering the level of this contest.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.700
I don't want her to participate!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.950
She came in a school uniform.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.620
I wonder if she's a country bumpkin...

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.830
A country bumpkin like her
should go home already.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.880
Go home! Go home!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:39.460
Go home! Go home! Go home!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.840
Ah! Hey!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.510
Don't leave the stage yet!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.100
Machi!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.430
What the heck is the matter, Machi?

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.520
I know you're nervous,

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.820
but this is the time to show
what you practiced!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:00.980
I won't participate.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:01.690
What?!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.450
I'm going back... to the village.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.240
Huh?!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.160
What are you saying, Machi?!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.830
Now, let's go back to the stage.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:10.490
Okay?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.220
M-Machi...

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:25.470
Machi!

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.510
No! Let go of me!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.260
I'm going home! I'm going home!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.470
Okay, I get it!

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.010
So calm down!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.810
Hey, you delinquent!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.060
Let go of me! Let go of me!

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:33.890
What are you doing?!

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:34.730
What?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.650
Hey, let her go!

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.230
No, you're getting this wrong!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.520
It's okay now!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.070
Don't judge people by their appearance!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:44.860
Machi!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.410
Natsu! Help me!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.620
Help me, Natsu!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:24.290
Kumamiko-chan!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.920
I'm hungry.

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.220
Natsu, I'm hungry.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.230
Why don't you go have some more lunch?

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:44.110
I'm hungry. I'm hungry.

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:47.400
I'm hungry, I'm hungry.

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:44.810
No good...

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:49.030
She just keeps repeating
the same line just like a zombie...

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:49.940
I'm hungry, I'm—

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:53.990
Kumamiko.
